  "solution": {
    "text": "1st the car is the source and at the cliff, one observes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>s</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>f</mi></math><br /><br />2<sup>nd</sup> cliff is now source. It emits frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math> and the observer is now the driver who observes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>''</mo></msup></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>''</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;&nbsp; or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>s</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>f</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mtext>as&#160;</mtext><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
